  "revision_note": "Match-view remediation (owner decisions MV-1..MV-5): every REJECTED expected result now carries P2T4.P2T4FusionInputRejectionV2@2.0 with a recomputed canonical digest; the 26 FUSED/UPSTREAM_FAILURE expected results are byte-identical to the G2 checkpoint; five hand-authored match-view cases were added (47 cases: 20 REJECTED, 27 non-rejected).",
