    "match_view_sentinel": "The fixed synthetic non-canonical policy_match_view_version sentinel is constructed only in the approved Python unit-test source, in memory. It is never stored in this manifest, cases-v1.json, expected-v1.json, any output, canonical bytes, failure snapshot, log, evidence, or report; fixture JSON records the mutation category only (SYNTHETIC_NONCANONICAL_SENTINEL or T4_POLICY_LITERAL). The T4_POLICY_LITERAL category resolves at runtime to policy.match_view_version, whose legitimate presence here is policy configuration and is not duplicated into any Vision input field or expected rejection."
  },
